ote that these are general trends and not absolutes. Individuals of any gender can exhibit a wide range of responses to stress, and personal coping styles can be influenced by many factors beyond gender. Encouraging healthy, adaptive coping mechanisms and emotional expression is important for everyone, regardless of gender."}
