steps. Do you have any questions for us?\n\n**Alex:** Yes, I\u2019d love to know more about the current projects the team is working on and how they align with the company\u2019s strategic goals.\n\n**Carol:** Absolutely, we can provide more details on that. Thank you again for your time today, Alex.\n\n**Alex:** Thank you, Carol and Richard. I look forward to hearing from you.\n\n*The interview concludes, and Alex leaves the room, while Carol and Richard discuss the candidate\u2019s performance.*"}
