ate's interpersonal skills, resilience, and ability to work effectively within a team.\n\nBy combining technical and behavioral evaluations, James and Barbara can gain a comprehensive understanding of the candidate's capabilities and fit within the company culture. This balanced approach helps ensure that the candidate is not only technically proficient but also well-suited to collaborate and contribute positively to the team."}
