ies or methodologies.\n\n6. **Cultural Fit:**\n   - Questions to determine if the candidate\u2019s values and work style align with the company culture.\n\n7. **Questions for the Interviewers:**\n   - The candidate might have the opportunity to ask questions about the company, role, team, or projects to assess their interest and fit.\n\nThroughout the interview, Elizabeth and Paul would likely be observing the candidate's communication skills, confidence, and overall demeanor to evaluate their potential fit within the team."}
