ces can help Maria and Steven support each other better. For instance, Maria could help Steven by encouraging him to break tasks into manageable steps, while Steven could help Maria by reminding her to take breaks and not overextend herself. Recognizing and respecting each other\u2019s coping styles can strengthen their relationship and improve their ability to handle stress together."}
