ngs with others.\n- **Coping Strategies**: David could focus on problem-solving and analytical methods, whereas Maria might use emotional expression and creative outlets.\n- **Stress Expression**: David may appear calm on the outside, while Maria might show her stress more visibly through her emotions.\n\nUnderstanding these differences can be beneficial for both David and Maria as they navigate stressful situations. By recognizing their unique coping styles, they can support each other effectively and develop strategies that incorporate both approaches."}
