hod as lacking. For example, George might see Lisa's emotional responses as impulsive, while Lisa might view George's detachment as cold or unempathetic.\n- **Personal Development**: Both George and Lisa could benefit from understanding and integrating aspects of each other's styles. George might develop greater empathy and emotional awareness, while Lisa could practice techniques to manage her emotions and enhance her decision-making process.\n\nUnderstanding these differences can help both George and Lisa navigate their interactions more effectively, especially in collaborative environments."}
