 on managing time effectively and developing strong study habits to succeed in high school and college.\n\n8. **Personal Development**: The session could also touch on personal growth opportunities, such as extracurricular activities, internships, or volunteer work, that can enhance college applications and personal development.\n\nOverall, the counselor's role is to support Jennifer and Robert in making informed decisions about their educational and career futures."}
