orkshops.\n\n8. **Feedback and Evaluation**: Provide regular, constructive feedback on their performance. At the end of their internship, conduct a formal evaluation to discuss their achievements and areas for improvement.\n\n9. **Foster Team Integration**: Encourage them to interact with other team members and integrate into the team. This can be facilitated through team meetings, collaborative projects, or social events.\n\n10. **Celebrate Successes**: Recognize and celebrate their achievements, no matter how small. This boosts their confidence and reinforces positive behavior.\n\nBy implementing these strategies, you can help Margaret and Donald have a productive and fulfilling internship experience, while also benefiting from their contributions to your team."}
