\n8. **Evaluate Progress**: Periodically review their progress towards their goals. Discuss what they have learned and what they hope to achieve by the end of their internship.\n\n9. **Celebrate Achievements**: Recognize and celebrate their accomplishments, no matter how small. This boosts their confidence and reinforces positive behavior.\n\n10. **Prepare for the Future**: Towards the end of their internship, discuss their experiences and what they have gained. Offer advice on steps they can take to continue their professional development.\n\nBy providing a supportive and challenging environment, you can help Mark and Ruth make the most of their internship and lay a strong foundation for their future careers."}
