encourage them to pursue those. This could be through attending workshops, taking online courses, or shadowing other departments.\n\n7. **Recognize and Reward Initiative**: When Dorothy or Brian show initiative, acknowledge their efforts. Recognition can be a powerful motivator and can encourage them to continue taking proactive steps in their roles.\n\n8. **Self-Reflection**: Encourage them to reflect on their experiences and the skills they are developing. This can help them identify areas for growth and set personal goals.\n\nBy fostering an environment where Dorothy and Brian feel empowered to take initiative and show activity, you'll not only help them succeed in their current roles but also equip them with valuable skills for their future careers."}
