g Opportunities**: Identify opportunities for them to learn new skills or gain exposure to different aspects of the business. This can be through training sessions, workshops, or hands-on projects.\n\nBy implementing these strategies, you can create a supportive and productive environment for Williams and Patricia, helping them develop the skills and confidence they need to succeed in their careers."}
