ices. Taking care of their own mental and emotional well-being can positively impact their relationship.\n\n9. **Celebrate Progress**: Recognize and celebrate small victories and improvements along the way. Acknowledging progress can boost motivation and reinforce positive changes.\n\nBy approaching counseling with an open mind and a willingness to work together, Karen and David can make meaningful strides in strengthening their relationship."}
