**: Encouraging both Mary and Daniel to build a support system outside of their relationship can be beneficial. This might include friends, family, or support groups that can offer additional perspectives and support.\n\n7. **Professional Guidance**: Both should be open to the guidance of their counselor, who can provide strategies and tools for improving their relationship dynamics.\n\nUltimately, the decision to continue or discontinue the relationship is a personal one and should be made based on what feels right and safe for Mary. It's important that any decision prioritizes her well-being and emotional health."}
