\n6. **Current Contributions**: If they are still contributing to the company, even while on leave (e.g., through remote work or flexible hours), this could demonstrate their dedication and resilience.\n\nUltimately, the decision will likely depend on a combination of these factors, as well as the specific dynamics and values of their workplace. It's important for Helen and Kenneth to communicate openly with their supervisors about their situation and any concerns they might have regarding their promotion prospects."}
