ideration of how the promotion of one over the other might affect team dynamics and morale could also be a factor. Ensuring a fair and transparent process is important to maintain trust and motivation among team members.\n\nUltimately, the decision would likely involve a comprehensive evaluation of these and potentially other factors, with the aim of selecting the candidate best suited for the promotion while maintaining fairness and transparency."}
