 and proactive communication often reflect positively on an employee's professionalism.\n\nUltimately, the decision will depend on a combination of these factors, as well as the specific culture and values of the organization. If both candidates are equally qualified and have similar circumstances regarding their leaves, the decision might come down to other differentiators such as leadership potential, specific project involvement, or interpersonal skills."}
